# Mansion gate guard (x3, faction faust). Talk your way in, bluff as EBI, or start the fight.
# ClearFlag('mansion_key') unlocks the front door: LockedDoors listen to their LockFlag.

%rec: OpeningBranch

cond: HasFlag('mansion_gate_open') || HasFlag('TalkedTo(logan_faust)')
goto: Cleared

cond: true
goto: Gate

%rec: Nodes

name: Gate
npc: (He steps into the drive, rifle slung low.)
+ Private property. State your business.
#
o_text: Catering. The Faust household ordered for tonight.
o_id: claim_caterer
o_test: RollSkill('social', 'Easy')
o_succ: LetIn
o_fail: Suspicious
#
o_text: Courier. Package for Mr. Faust, signature required.
o_id: claim_courier
o_test: RollSkill('social', 'Easy')
o_succ: LetIn
o_fail: Suspicious
#
o_text: EBI. Step aside, or this whole place is cordoned off by morning.
o_id: claim_ebi
o_test: RollSkill('intimidate', 'Hard')
o_succ: EbiBluff
o_fail: EbiFail
#
o_text: Just looking.
o_id: just_looking
o_goto: End
#
o_text: Wrong answer.
o_id: wrong_answer
o_goto: Fight

name: LetIn
npc: (He thumbs his radio.) Delivery coming up. Open the front.
+ Straight through the hall, kitchen's at the back. Don't wander.
effect: SetFlag('mansion_gate_open')
effect: ClearFlag('mansion_key')
#
o_text: Appreciated.
o_id: gate_thanks
o_goto: End

name: Suspicious
npc: Nobody told me about a delivery. Who booked it?
#
o_text: Ask the house. Mira Sykes signed for it.
o_id: ask_mira
o_test: RollSkill('social', 'Hard')
o_succ: LetIn
o_fail: Refused
#
o_text: Must be the wrong address. I'll go.
o_id: gate_leave
o_goto: End
#
o_text: Wrong answer.
o_id: wrong_answer_suspicious
o_goto: Fight

name: Refused
npc: Sykes doesn't sign for anything. Turn around and walk, slowly.
#
o_text: Fine.
o_id: refused_leave
o_goto: End
#
o_text: Wrong answer.
o_id: wrong_answer_refused
o_goto: Fight

name: EbiBluff
npc: (He goes a shade paler.) Nobody said anything about... go on in. I never saw you.
effect: SetFlag('mansion_gate_open')
effect: ClearFlag('mansion_key')
#
o_text: Smart.
o_id: ebi_smart
o_goto: End

name: EbiFail
npc: EBI doesn't send one guy in a dirty coat. Walk away while you can.
#
o_text: Your funeral.
o_id: ebi_fail_leave
o_goto: End
#
o_text: Wrong answer.
o_id: wrong_answer_ebi
o_goto: Fight

name: Fight
npc: Wrong address, choomba.
effect: StartCombat

name: Cleared
npc: Go on through. They know you're here.
#
o_text: Thanks.
o_id: cleared_thanks
o_goto: End

name: End
npc: (He turns back to the empty road.)
effect: EndConversation
